# The close-head conjunct of Armed dropped: the core's own guard, distinct from
# H's guarantee. An activation arms after a close without replaying to the heads
# the close recorded, and passes a foreign record below them. It edits the Armed
# predicate, so it names no perturbed action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestArmsBelowCloseHead
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms without replaying to the last close's heads

--- FIND
    /\ ~pend
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1

--- REPLACE
    /\ ~pend
    /\ ~hoOpen
\* MUTATION: no replay to the close heads.

--- END
